&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re an equal-opportunity employer. You will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran, or disability status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
