&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage your day independently with strong clinical leadership and collaborative support behind you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
